          "quote": "让心内科帮您一并评估血压控制和后续用药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor emphasizes blood-pressure management and directs the family to confirm the antihypertensive plan with the cardiology or primary-care service. This meets RC5.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
